# Telephony provider principle

Canonical: `docs/foundations/COMMUNICATIONS.md` (Provider-agnostic telephony)

- **TelephonyProvider** adapter owns SMS · programmable voice · numbers — not Core Communication records.
- **Twilio** = first production adapter. **Telnyx** = evaluate before volume. Do not hard-wire Communications to one CPaaS.
- **ElevenLabs** = Voice Provider (synthesis / ConvAI) — separate from telephony.
- Customer copy: **Connect business phone** / **Connect SMS** — never “Connect Twilio” or Messaging API jargon.
- Apps never call carrier APIs directly — Communication Service → `getTelephonyProvider()`.
- AU ACMA sender-ID rules apply regardless of provider — enforce in DigitalGate.
